From f658d7c6712687dc9c33a113d3567726e9caceb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: harness <h@l>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:46:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] refactor(imports): use the @/ alias instead of ../
 relative imports

No more ../ or ./../ imports inside the app: every cross-folder import is @/<path from the project root> (tsconfig paths '@/*' already existed and 35 files already used it). Easier to read and to move files later.
